n a phone, gets found on Google, and lets a customer book you right there on the page."},{"key":"t6","label":"Text: You see: People who find you can actually reac…","value":"You see: People who find you can actually reach you."},{"key":"t7","label":"Text: Speed to Lead","value":"Speed to Lead"},{"key":"t8","label":"Text: Every call and every form answered in seconds,…","value":"Every call and every form answered in seconds, day or night, before that person tries the next company on their list."},{"key":"t9","label":"Text: You see: Fewer customers slipping away while y…","value":"You see: Fewer customers slipping away while you are busy."},{"key":"t10","label":"Text: Automated Five Star Reviews","value":"Automated Five Star Reviews"},{"key":"t11","label":"Text: Every happy customer asked for a review, every…","value":"Every happy customer asked for a review, every single time, without anybody having to remember to do it."},{"key":"t12","label":"Text: You see: Your star rating climbing without you…","value":"You see: Your star rating climbing without you touching it."},{"key":"t13","label":"Text: Database Reactivation","value":"Database Reactivation"},{"key":"t14","label":"Text: Everybody who ever called you and never booked…","value":"Everybody who ever called you and never booked gets contacted again. You already paid to get those names."},{"key":"t15","label":"Text: You see: Old names turning back into appointme…","value":"You see: Old names turning back into appointments."},{"key":"t16","label":"Text: Paid Ads = Booked Appointments","value":"Paid Ads = Booked Appointments"},{"key":"t17","label":"Text: We run the advertising and answer everything t…","value":"We run the advertising and answer everything that comes in, so what reaches you is a time on your calendar."},{"key":"t18","label":"Text: You see: Appointments, not a list of people to…","value":"You see: Appointments, not a list of people to call."},{"key":"t19","label":"Text: AI Implementation","value":"AI Implementation"},{"key":"t20","label":"Text: We connect all of it to the software you alrea…","value":"This is where we use the latest frontier AI models to connect all the different software that you use. Your website is software. Your CRM is software. All five of these automated systems are different pieces of software that need to communicate with each other behind the scenes and make everything seamless."},{"key":"t21","label":"Text: You see: One machine instead of five things to…","value":"So you see: One machine instead of five things that you have to manually take care of."}],"boxes":[],"links":[{"key":"h1","href":"/premium-smart-websites","label":"Premium Smart Websites"},{"key":"h2","href":"/speed-to-lead","label":"Speed to Lead"},{"key":"h3","href":"/automated-five-star-reviews","label":"Automated Five Star Reviews"},{"key":"h4","href":"/database-reactivation","label":"Database Reactivation"},{"key":"h5","href":"/booked-appointments","label":"Paid Ads = Booked Appointments"},{"key":"h6","href":"/ai-implementation","label":"AI Implementation"}],"sheet":"7b6d59e91bbcfde5","images":[],"calLink":"","hasForm":false,"background":"","formButton":"","formFields":[],"paddingTop":80,"useRealForm":false,"paddingBottom":88}},{"type":"DesignSection","props":{"id":"design-machine","band":"mist","html":"<section class=\"code-section pt-15 pb-5 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-7\" id=\"sjcmachine\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n    <div class=\"text-left\">\n      <div class=\"label\">{{t:t1}}</div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-3xl font-bold font-[var(--font-family-heading)] leading-tight mb-6\">\n        {{t:t2}}\n      </h2>\n\n      <p class=\"text-xl font-[var(--font-family-body)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n        {{t:t3}}\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-xl font-[var(--font-family-body)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n        {{t:t4}}\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"text-xl font-[var(--font-family-body)] leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n        {{t:t5}}\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","text":[{"key":"t1","label":"Text: Being a business owner is hard enough","value":"Being a business owner is hard enough"},{"key":"t2","label":"Text: Getting all of your systems and processes work…","value":"Getting all of your systems and processes working together is our job."},{"key":"t3","label":"Text: You can build every one of these systems on yo…","value":"You can build every one of these systems on your own. Plenty of owners have. They end with five different system logins that do not talk to each other, and you are still the person holding it all together in your head."},{"key":"t4","label":"Text: The real work is connecting them to the softwa…","value":"The real work is connecting them to the software you already run, so a customer who reaches out at nine at night gets answered, booked, reminded and asked for a review without you touching any of it."},{"key":"t5","label":"Text: Nothing gets ripped out. Nobody has to learn a…","value":""}],"boxes":[],"links":[],"sheet":"7b6d59e91bbcfde5","images":[],"calLink":"","hasForm":false,"formButton":"","formFields":[],"paddingTop":76,"useRealForm":false,"paddingBottom":72}},{"type":"DesignSection","props":{"id":"design-7","band":null,"html":"<section class=\"code-section bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--primary-color)] to-[var(--accent3-color)] pt-4 pb-4 lg:pt-6 lg:pb-6 scroll-mt-20 lg:scroll-mt-24 relative overflow-hidden\" id=\"sxq4oqf\">\n  \n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n  <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white opacity-5 rounded-full blur-3xl\"></div>\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10\">\n    \n    <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-3xl font-bold font-[var(--font-family-heading)] text-white mb-4\">\n        {{t:t1}}\n      </h2>\n    </div>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-8\">\n      \n   